    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49881.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Thank you for joining us today. We are so honored to be in conversation with the Governor of Washington State, Jay Inslee. Governor Inslee joined us to talk about his participation in the Reproductive Freedom Alliance, a group of governors who are coming together to share strategies and ideas on how to better protect reproductive rights in their respective states. We talk about so much more than that. We talk about the lessons he learned from the COVID War. We talk about climate change. He even joined us outside politics to share the fact that he illustrates books for his holiday Christmas card list. You know where Christmas card devotees here at Pantsuit Politics, so we were very excited to add him to the club.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_05",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
