    "turn_text": "I want to ask you about climate. I know that you've just signed into law and measure that links Washington's carbon market with California and Quebec. I would love to hear about that. And for those of us in states that are not moving on climate change at the pace and scale that Washington has moved, can you give us some foundational knowledge about that emissions auction about the market that you all have created to try to bring some policy to this issue?",
