  {
    "episode_id": 49881,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49881.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "I'm struck listening to you talk about this breath of issues by the fact that I read that you began your political career working on a local school issue. And a lot of people listening are at that stage where they have kids in elementary school or middle school. They're thinking about contributing to their civic life more and differently. I wonder what advice you would give to people at that stage looking back over your career from this place where you now work on gun violence and climate and economic growth. and following the science.",
